 rats have gone, the greedy mayor refuses to pay – so the Pirate Piper plays an enchanted tune and leads the children away. It's up to Matilda, Jim and Nugget to save their friends.\n\nThe fourth title in Jonny Duddle's bestselling Jolley-Rogers fiction series. ","category":"stories","author":"Jonny Duddle","previewAudio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/jonny-duddle-jolley-rogers-and-the-pirate-piper.mp3","abridged":false,"accent":"UK English","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/c2ac1595563a9857899a22457c1b13c0c963f359d4e88e8fb99f3d76def24d80/TI5Xp3Qm3P8oDZq1zowycEvNUOkliIKymNDHMB6BPzg.mp3","copyright":"© 2019 by Jonny Duddle; ℗ 2019 by Templar an imprint of Bonnier Books UK; Cover design by © Jonny Duddle","maxAge":8,"minAge":5,"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/Qs8ylID6ajiw49AQcJMnYTdXkqVB8pVLhy2dF4DOVHs"},"languages":["en"],"status":{"name":"live","updatedAt":"2020-11-19T12:50:28.211Z"},"media":{"duration":4771,"fileSize":39555020,"hasStreams":false},"accents":["UK English"],"authors":["Jonny Duddle"],"copyrights":["© 2019 by Jonny Duddle","℗ 2019 by Templar an imprint of Bonnier Books UK","Cover design by © Jonny Duddle"],"genres":["fantasy","action-and-adventure"],"narrators":["Paul Panting","Amy Enticknap"]},"slug":"jonny-duddle-jolley-rogers-and-the-pirate-piper","title":"Jolley-Rogers and the Pirate Piper","updatedAt":"2021-01-22T14:31:10.172Z","userId":"yoto","sortkey":"jonny-duddle-jolley-rogers-and-the-pirate-piper"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}